        14
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Albion%2C_Nebraska"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "In 1873 Albion was designated the county seat of Boone County.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        15
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Albion%2C_Nebraska"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The Boone County Museum, run by volunteers, offers rotating displays and educational events for locals and school groups.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        1
