      ],
      "source": "https://boone-county.org/activities/boone-county-museum/"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Albion expanded rapidly in 1880‑81 after the railroad reached it, becoming the terminus of the Omaha, Niobrara & Black Hills line.",
